# Proposed Equine Health V1.1 Vocabulary Delta

Add controlled terms and distinctions for:

- clinical authority;
- treatment authority;
- canonical health fact;
- provider source record;
- private or deliberative note;
- operational care record;
- owner observation;
- continuity projection;
- medication order;
- medication administration;
- high-risk or legally restricted treatment;
- imported or device-generated evidence;
- health continuity package;
- welfare-preserving emergency action;
- non-authoritative clinical support.

Preserve the rule that evidence, account type, appointment, payment, upload, possession, Care Circle membership, and external-system state do not independently create clinical authority.

Proposal only. Exact vocabulary-source modification requires separate verification.
